<!--
  RUT_NightHorrors_Races.xml - HORRORS_RAIDING_FACTION_1 (2026-11-02). Plain ports of mlie.horrors' Bulwark, Harvester,
  Prowler and BroodLord (+ their BulwarkBody / BodyProwler bodies and the Prowler's own parts) as the starved-cold forms of
  the Assailant weapon (design/Jawa/worldbuilding/biomes/assailant_weapon_remnants.md). Generated once from the donor XML;
  stats, verbs, bodies and life stages verbatim except: cold-adapted (ComfyTemperatureMin -60, was 0); the donor's
  HiveMind/HorrorConstant think trees and NamerAnimalHorrors dropped (default animal think tree; the RUT_Horrors raid lord
  drives them); the Prowler's spit Verb_Shoot dropped (vanilla animal AI never fires a race ranged verb); BaseHorror's
  abstract stats inlined, as RM_Visceral.xml did. Raptorial legs reuse RM_Visceral.xml's RM_ parts. Art: donor bundle
  textures copied to Textures/RimUtinni/UtinniPatches/NightHorrors/ (stand-in, downscaled to 512 px); the young stages
  borrow RM_Visceral's redraw as the donor did. Faction, raid and lairs: RUT_NightHorrors.xml.
-->
