  <ThingDef ParentName="AnimalThingBase">
    <defName>RUT_HorrorBulwark</defName>
    <label>bulwark</label>
    <description>A siege form of the Assailant weapon, hardened by the long cold of the nightside: a massive plated beast bred to break walls, doors and hulls. It lies dormant in the ice for years and wakes slow and patient. Explosives and armour-piercing weapons, or better yet landmines.</description>
